  "FLINK-31677": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-31677",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Add MAP_ENTRIES supported in SQL & Table API",
    "description": "map_entries(map) - Returns an unordered array of all entries in the given map.\r\n\r\nSyntax:\r\nmap_entries(map)\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\nmap: An MAP to be handled.\r\n\r\nReturns:\r\n\r\nReturns an unordered array of all entries in the given map.\r\n\r\nReturns null if the argument is null\r\n{code:sql}\r\n\r\n> SELECT map_entries(map[1, 'a', 2, 'b']);\r\n [(1,\"a\"),(2,\"b\")]{code}\r\nSee also\r\npresto [https://prestodb.io/docs/current/functions/map.html]\r\n\r\nspark https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/api/sql/index.html#map_entries",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "82b7870a014a989054931ad65940196b2baff052",
